f $l(\\theta ):$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}l}{\\text{d}\\theta } & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}\\theta }(-8\\operatorname{ln}⁡(2\\pi )-9.6+12.6\\text{ }\\,\\theta -8\\text{ }\\,{\\theta }^{2}) \\\\  & =12.6-16\\text{ }\\,\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we set the derivative equal to $0$ and solve for $\\theta :$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12.6-16\\text{ }\\,\\theta  & =0 \\\\ 16\\text{ }\\,\\theta  & =12.6 \\\\ \\theta  & ≈0.788\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, for this sample, the maximum likelihood estimate of $\\theta $ is $\\overset{^}{\\,\\theta \\,}≈0.788,$ rounded to $3$ decimal places." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-0e02fd70-4bfa-5ee0-87ea-68ee321a3054"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-0e02fd70-4bfa-5ee0-87ea-68ee321a3054" :answer-field/id #uuid "0e02fd70-4bfa-5ee0-87ea-68ee321a3054" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7ae6bb66-be05-5dcb-8863-b23c52551053" :answer-field/choices ["answer-c3d0c384-6c7e-5b36-a4e1-184863f1c6e7" "answer-7ae6bb66-be05-5dcb-8863-b23c52551053" "answer-f18f76ba-32bc-57a4-ac9a-52ff4682af02" "answer-fa0b1bf7-e11d-54c6-a696-04e144a0cba6" "answer-23fcd9a5-0cf5-5d2e-97e7-871a82a5410c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c3d0c384-6c7e-5b36-a4e1-184863f1c6e7" :answer/id #uuid "c3d0c384-6c7e-5b36-a4e1-184863f1c6e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.778" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7ae6bb66-be05-5dcb-8863-b23c52551053" :answer/id #uuid "7ae6bb66-be05-5dcb-8863-b23c52551053" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.788" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f18f76ba-32bc-57a4-ac9a-52ff4682af02" :answer/id #uuid "f18f76ba-32bc-57a4-ac9a-52ff4682af02" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.817" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fa0b1bf7-e11d-54c6-a696-04e144a0cba6" :answer/id #uuid "fa0b1bf7-e11d